# Dev Notes 21 — Worker Layout Option C Preflight Tests v1

Status: staged, syntax-checked, helper-checked, mock-smoke-tested, artifact-guarded locally against the sandbox candidate.

## Purpose

This branch adds preflight test and fixture infrastructure before production code movement in `llama_worker/llama.mjs`.

The goal is to create regression guards for the later Option C worker split around:

- exact worker protocol message shape;
- stream ordering and parent final-result settlement behavior;
- worker-side model path immutability;
- runtime fixture-copy coverage;
- future `llama_worker/**` import-cycle hygiene.

## Source base

Sandbox candidate was staged from the current local formatted mirror at:

```text
/mnt/data/review_repo_mod/runtime-dev-repo-modularization
```

That mirror has the post-parent-layout compact root shape:

```text
runtime.mjs
workerBridge.mjs
runtime/**
llama_worker/llama.mjs
tests/**
```

GitHub `modularization` remains the intended source truth before upload/merge verification.

